                        <p><strong>Neuroplasticity</strong> is the brain's most remarkable feature. Unlike a computer chip with fixed circuits, your brain is constantly rewiring itself based on your experiences. Every time you learn something new, neurons form new connections. Every time you practice a skill, those connections get stronger.</p>
