                        <p>If your brain is constructing reality rather than passively receiving it, then every brain\u2014with its unique wiring, experiences, and neurochemistry\u2014is building a <strong>slightly different version of the world</strong>. Your "red" is a construction of your visual cortex, shaped by your unique genes and experience. It may not be the same as mine.</p>
